How to Build and Run:

Steps (in VS Code terminal):
1. Compile MPI.cpp
    C:\msys64\ucrt64\bin\g++.exe -g lab6.cpp -I"C:/Program Files (x86)/Microsoft SDKs/MPI/Include" -L"C:/Program Files (x86)/Microsoft SDKs/MPI/Lib/x64" -lmsmpi -o lab6.exe

2. Start the program
    mpiexec -np 4 lab6.exe flowers.bmp
